# Reference implementation vendor assets (large downloaded binaries; see
# eval/sysml_reference/reference_driver.py for how to re-fetch and rebuild
# them). Not tracked in the repo to avoid bloating it.
eval/sysml_reference/vendor/*.conda
eval/sysml_reference/vendor/_extracted/
eval/sysml_reference/vendor/*.class
eval/sysml_reference/sysml.library/
eval/sysml_reference/__pycache__/

# Evaluation corpora and run results (regenerable; large). The harness itself
# (scripts/run_reference_comparison_eval.py, scripts/analyze_reference_comparison.py,
# eval/sysml_reference/reference_driver.py, eval/sysml_reference/vendor/RefDriver.java)
# and the comparison report ARE tracked -- only the inputs and outputs are not.
# - sysml_samples/  : 221MB, third-party OSS models catalogued in manifest.json.
# - sysml_results/  : per-sample local-vs-reference comparison output (7.4MB).
# - results/        : golden-set / conformance eval run results (3.8MB).
# - rule_agreement.json / recheck_*.json : recheck_local_only.py の集計出力。
#   ルール別の一致率はここから確認したうえで、レビュー済みスナップショットだけを
#   sysml_v2_checker_advanced 配下へ取り込む（Viewer Phase C の C0/C1）。
eval/sysml_samples/
eval/sysml_results/
eval/sysml_results_baseline_*/
eval/results/
eval/rule_agreement.json
eval/recheck_*.json
eval/low_confidence_rules.json

